@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
left to right direction
title 学术成果分享平台系统用例图（成员1方案A参考）

actor 访客 as Guest
actor 登录用户 as User
actor 已认领学者 as Scholar
actor 平台管理员 as Admin
actor 外部数据源 as Source
actor 定时调度器 as Scheduler

User --|> Guest
Scholar --|> User

rectangle "学术成果分享平台" {
  usecase "检索成果与学者" as UC_Search
  usecase "查看成果详情\n与学者门户" as UC_View
  usecase "查看统计分析" as UC_Stats
  usecase "登录与退出" as UC_Auth
  usecase "提交门户认领" as UC_Claim
  usecase "查询本人认领状态" as UC_ClaimStatus
  usecase "审核门户认领" as UC_Review
  usecase "维护本人门户\n与成果关联" as UC_Maintain
  usecase "管理采集任务" as UC_Collect
  usecase "执行清洗、去重\n和消歧" as UC_Process
  usecase "处理数据治理问题" as UC_Govern
}

Guest -- UC_Search
Guest -- UC_View
Guest -- UC_Stats
User -- UC_Auth
User -- UC_Claim
User -- UC_ClaimStatus
Scholar -- UC_Maintain
Admin -- UC_Auth
Admin -- UC_Review
Admin -- UC_Collect
Admin -- UC_Process
Admin -- UC_Govern
Source -- UC_Collect
Scheduler -- UC_Collect

note bottom of UC_Review
  申请者与审核者不得为同一账号；
  通过状态、授权和审计保持一致。
end note

note bottom of UC_Collect
  只使用经批准的数据源；
  定时调度器只能触发已批准任务。
end note

note right of UC_Auth
  认领、维护和全部管理用例
  以有效会话及服务端授权为前置条件。
end note
@enduml
